          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">Kroot gain +1 to their Cover Save in woods or jungles. Kroot in woods or jungles do not have to roll a Difficult Terrain test; they can always move up to 6"</characteristic>
