        <rule id="de0a-4c4b-e11e-4451-a9821" name="Blademaster" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>When in challenge, Aun'Shi must choose a fighting stance each turn, before any To-Hit rolls are made in the challenge:
Patient Blade: re-roll all failed saving throws until the end of the current phase.
Killing Blade: Rending until the end of the current phase.</description>
