    <selectionEntry id="910d-ec84-d003-021a-a9821" name="Ethereal Honour Guard" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="d452-d9ae-a90f-884e-a9821" name="Swift Redeployment" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>At the start of your movement phase, pick one unit from this Formation that is within 12" of its Ethereal. Now choose a single model in the unit you picked to be the lynchpin around which the rest of the unit will reform; remove all other models in the unit from the battlefield (do not remove the DS8 Tactical Support Turret if there is one) and immediately set them up again within 3" of the lynchpin. The unit does not count as moving; it may move normally in the same movement phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups>
