                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the enemy Assault phase, nominate an enemy unit within 12" and then roll a D3. If, during that Assault phase, the nominated unit attempts to assault the Grav-inhibitor Drone or its unit, decrease that unit's charge move by the result of the D3 (to a minimum of 0).</characteristic>
