          <modifiers />
          <description>Roll a dice each time a successful cover save is made for a model within 1" of a Tidewall Shieldline's energy barrier, so long as the barrier is between the attacker and the target. On a roll of 6 the attacking unit suffers 1 Randomly Allocated Wound or glancing hit, resolved at the same AP as the attacking weapon.</description>
