            <selectionEntry id="f05c63e1-6a8e-40ce-31f7-c41f0ae1e39d-a9821" name="XV02 Pilot Battlesuit" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles />
              <rules>
                <rule id="95e1-2e82-d626-613e-a9821" name="XV02 Pilot Battlesuit" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>The XV02 Pilot Battlesuit incorporates a Blacksun Filter. Longstrike's TX7 Hammerhead can fire Overwatch and has the Supporting Fire special rule. Furthermore, Longstrike's TX7 Hammerhead is not limited to firing Overwatch once each phase (it can still only fire Overwatch once against each eligible charging unit).</description>
